      "writtenOn": "2023-09-28T17:48:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry I meant it is for the case when the user passed in a cr50 image. We do not want to try to find a dauntless chip. I can introduce more variable names, but it would just make to fw_image_data !\u003d NULL.\n\nI tried refactoring this to drop the `fw_image_data` condition, but then I realized we would try to flash a cr50 image on a dauntless chip (which we want to prevent).\n\nI am open to suggestions on how to rewrite this to make it more clear.",
      "parentUuid": "93ea53f4_4493864c",
