      "writtenOn": "2023-09-28T18:30:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "will this work:\n\nin line 4754 we say\n\n```\nif (is_dauntless \u0026\u0026 (image_magic !\u003d MAGIC_DAUNTLESS)) {\n   print(\"Unexpected image for Ti50 programming\\n\");\n   exit(update_errror);\n}\nif (image_magic \u003d\u003d MAGIC_DAUNTLESS) {\n pid \u003d D2_PID;\n} else if (image_magic \u003d\u003d MAGIC_HAVEN) {\n pid \u003d H1_PID;\n} else {\n  printf(\"Unsupported GSC image\\n\");\n  exit(update_error);\n}\n```\n\nand then we don\u0027t even need to check for the alternative here  - if USB connection failed it means we can\u0027t talk to the device we want to talk to.",
      "parentUuid": "f7735eff_b0f774d8",
